   "persona": "Admin-level IT person at a company called Granite Peak Co. Reasonably technical (handled an Okta to Entra ID migration and rebuilt an app from a setup guide). Tone is calm, matter-of-fact and a bit dry. Writes short, plain, complete sentences with no pleasantries or emoji. Gives details only when asked, and gives them briefly. Mildly constructive at the end, offering product feedback on the guide once the problem is fixed. Patient and cooperative, not angry.",
